+    /* browser-lite: until the server announced its MAX_CONCURRENT_STREAMS,
+     * a new connection carries only the transfers it has. More streams could
+     * exceed the limit, and servers reset those (Envoy even with
+     * FLOW_CONTROL_ERROR, which is not retried). Most servers send their
+     * SETTINGS with the end of the TLS handshake: there the wait is short. */
+    if(m->data->set.pipewait &&
